  "details": "Ok, I am totally fine with the menu downloading avatars for the previews when I click on them. But why the hell do you keep loading them after I closed the menu? This is wasting my bandwidth, vram and make the game stutter.\n\nHow to reproduce it?\n\n1. Clean your cache\n\n2. Open your menu and randomly click on every avatars you can find.\n\n3. Close the menu\n\n4. Notice your bandwidth keeps downloading all of them and loading them, making your game stutter and lagging.\n\nSolution I suggest: When you close the menu, EVERY background tasks related to the menu should be terminated. There is no reason for a closed menu to take ressources.",
